1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,491
Did you know that our Earth
is like a giant spinning top?

2
00:00:03,491 --> 00:00:04,527
It spins really fast

3
00:00:04,527 --> 00:00:04,923
about 1

4
00:00:04,923 --> 00:00:06,108
600 kilometers per hour!

5
00:00:06,108 --> 00:00:09,308
That's much faster than even
the fastest car you can
imagine

6
00:00:09,308 --> 00:00:11,926
But here’s something
curious: we don’t feel a
thing!

7
00:00:11,926 --> 00:00:15,708
You might wonder why we
don't get dizzy or fly off the
surface

8
00:00:15,708 --> 00:00:15,984
Well

9
00:00:15,984 --> 00:00:18,617
it's all thanks to a clever
force called gravity

10
00:00:18,617 --> 00:00:22,208
Imagine it like an invisible
hand holding you snugly to
the ground

11
00:00:22,208 --> 00:00:22,690
like when

12
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:24,690
you’re tucked under a cozy
blanket

13
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:28,190
And here’s another cool
part of the story: the air
around us

14
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:28,763
called the

15
00:00:28,763 --> 00:00:29,327
atmosphere

16
00:00:29,327 --> 00:00:30,763
spins right along with Earth

17
00:00:30,763 --> 00:00:34,255
It’s like when you sit on a
merry-go-round with all your
friends

18
00:00:34,255 --> 00:00:36,688
Because everything moves
together — the trees

19
00:00:36,688 --> 00:00:37,216
buildings

20
00:00:37,216 --> 00:00:38,328
and even you — all in

21
00:00:38,328 --> 00:00:38,771
one big

22
00:00:38,771 --> 00:00:39,491
steady swirl

23
00:00:39,491 --> 00:00:41,819
you don’t feel like you’re
spinning at all

24
00:00:41,819 --> 00:00:43,158
Next time you’re outside

25
00:00:43,158 --> 00:00:45,892
look at the sky and
remember that although it
feels

26
00:00:45,892 --> 00:00:46,640
calm and still

27
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:49,383
we’re all gliding along this
amazing ride through space

